{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15344180","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15344180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1534418001:0":{"text":"모든 아쿠보르 전사는 보물을 찾는 여정을 떠나야 해. 종착지에 도착하면 귀한 보물을 얻을 수 있지.","source_cn":"每一位雅库伯尔的勇士，都要踏上一场寻宝之旅。当勇士抵达...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58D9382A86F7DD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1534418002:0":{"text":"하지만 그건 결코 쉽지 않은 여정이야. 인내심, 용기, 지혜를 시험하는 여정이기도 하단다.","source_cn":"但寻宝之旅并不是轻松的旅途，而是对耐心、勇气、智慧的考验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB009C445C3525F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1534418003:0":{"text":"이번 이야기의 주인공은 곧 보물을 찾는 여정을 떠나는 용사란다...","source_cn":"这次故事的主角，就是一个即将踏上寻宝之旅的勇士……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB8F46008274E3A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:老兽人暗眼":{"text":"늙은 루나애니 다크아이","source":"老兽人暗眼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}